WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.657
Open Enquiries for quote requests and contact messages.

00:00:04.707 --> 00:00:09.324
Filter by status, switch between quote requests and messages,

00:00:09.374 --> 00:00:12.001
or search by name, email, or phone.

00:00:12.051 --> 00:00:15.673
Selecting a row expands the original submission,

00:00:15.723 --> 00:00:19.116
so you can read it without leaving the inbox.
